### Editar punto de una ejecución (por locationId) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/editLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "locationId": 1,
  "locationName": "Punto A - Actualizado",
  "radius": 150,
  "minTime": 15,
  "maxTime": 45
}

### Editar punto identificado por privateCode con ventana horaria — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/editLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "privateCode": "REF-EXISTENTE",
  "comments": "Ventana de atención actualizada",
  "minHour": "2026-08-21T09:00:00",
  "maxHour": "2026-08-21T16:00:00"
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/editLocation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "locationId": 1,
  "minTime": 15
}

### Sin workPlanExecutionId (requerido) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/editLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "locationId": 1,
  "locationName": "Sin ejecución"
}

### Ejecución inexistente → 400/500 según manejo del SP
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/editLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 999999999,
  "locationId": 1,
  "minTime": 10
}
